      "measure.moments_normalized": "Fixed owning 4x4 moment tensors are prepared outside timing; dtype is the actual mu/nu input dtype, not an image label. Normalization keeps NumPy scalar powers, first division, promotion and assignment providers with an owned final scalar divide; Hu keeps dtype conversion and output wrapping around owned C++ polynomial arithmetic. Each timed public call includes its own allocation and conversions. Integer normalization raises the source NaN-assignment error and has no timing row.",
